 r←Test_TableEdit_033(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ The user is asked whether she sees just a horizontal scrollbar.
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 :If batchFlag
     r←¯1
 :Else
     table←⍉⊃('Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy' 'Carter')(1 0 1 0 1 1)
     table←200 200⍴table
     parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.CreateParms
     parms.posn←35 25
     parms.size←400 600
     parms.caption←'Test_Table_002: just a horizontal scroll bars'
     parms.confirmQuit←0
     parms.testMode←1

     ⎕←'This test requires just one scroll bar (horizontal) to show up. When you are ready to continue press <Enter>'
     0⍴⍞

     n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Table.Create table #._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms

     r←~∆PromptForSuccess'Do you see just a horizontal scroll bar?'

∆TidyUp:
     n.∆CloseForm
 :EndIf
